  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LVA-Training Adm Saeima</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utbildn adm lett Saeima</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrat ledarskap och administration av Saeima, Administrative Office, som d&#xe4;rmed kan erbjuda b&#xe4;ttre service till ledam&#xf6;terna av Saeima. De administrativa metoder och tekniker som nyttjas skall vara i linje med europeisk standard, vilket skall ge m&#xf6;jlighet att samarbeta med andra europeiska parlament p&#xe5; j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lld niv&#xe5;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training of the Parliament&apos;s administration to improve management, performance and efficiency of its function and services to the Parliament. Methods and techniques shall meet European standard as to policies and regulations within EU and facilitate cooperation with other European parliaments on equal footing.</narrative>
  </description>
